OL,3,GNEWSAIsland tops 1m air passengers
OL,4,Aafter summer boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassenger numbers rose across Jersey's
OL,7,Ftransport hubs during the busy summer
OL,8,Fmonths, with more than one million
OL,9,Fpeople passing through the airport so
OL,10,Ffar this year, according to official
OL,11,Fstatistics.
OL,13,FPorts of Jersey said more than 472,000
OL,14,Fpassengers travelled through Jersey
OL,15,FAirport between July and September, up
OL,16,F4.2% on the same period in 2025.
OL,18,FNearly 200,000 passengers travelled
OL,19,Fthrough Jersey Harbour, while ferry
OL,20,Foperator DFDS carried 10% more
OL,21,Fpassengers than it did during the third
OL,22,Fquarter of last year.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
