OL,3,GNEWSAIsland tops 1m air passengers
OL,4,Aafter summer boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Holley, head of connectivity at
OL,7,FPorts of Jersey, said it was
OL,8,F"encouraging to see sustained growth".
